    "Tap to switch between the bouncing ball and the orbit ring — or say “bounce” / “orbit”." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the action to take to switch between the bouncing ball and the orbit ring.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
